# Antwoord skermgreep folder — one set per slide (01, 02, 03, …)
#
# --- Website assets (loaded by the carousel) ---
#
#   01.png          light-mode screenshot
#   01-dark.png     dark-mode screenshot
#   01.mp3          narration audio
#   01.txt          optional on-screen copy (overrides antwoord.html for that slide)
#
#   02.png + 02-dark.png + 02.mp3 + 02.txt
#   …
#
# --- Author only (never loaded by the website) ---
#
#   talk-01.txt     your spoken script when recording 01.mp3
#
# Workflow:
#   1. Copy 01.png (and 01-dark.png when ready) into this folder
#   2. Write talk-01.txt → record → save as 01.mp3
#   3. Optionally add NN.txt to override HTML text for slide NN
#   4. Run website/sync-text.bat (only needed for file:// preview)
